From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:45:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: apple,s8000-display-pipe: Make the
 description a literal block

The description's plain multi-line scalar contains "own: it must", which
YAML reads as a mapping, so the schema does not load. Make it a literal
block.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/display/apple,s8000-display-pipe.yaml   | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/apple,s8000-display-pipe.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/apple,s8000-display-pipe.yaml
index 7626d7f..a74e9fd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/apple,s8000-display-pipe.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/apple,s8000-display-pipe.yaml
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@ title: Apple A9 display pipe (disp0)
 maintainers:
   - Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
 
-description:
+description: |
   The display subsystem of the Apple A9 SoCs (S8000/S8003), called "disp0"
   with the compatible "adbe0,s8000" in the Apple device tree. It contains
   the ADP/ADBE display pipe that scans out to the internal eDP panel. The
